{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is <strong>OK to stream/broadcast</strong>. However, please ensure the game title, <strong>&quot;O-Sushi Claw Machine,&quot;</strong> is included in the video description or summary section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300eSushi Claw Machine\u300f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh take on the crane game genre, set in a Japanese conveyor belt sushi restaurant! Experience the ultimate claw machine simulation, bringing the excitement and authentic arcade atmosphere right to your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a physics-based crane arm to grab a variety of colorful sushi plates as they glide by on the conveyor belt. The price of the sushi you grab is added to your total, and the total cost of your feast becomes your final score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the gameplay is simple enough for anyone to enjoy, its deep strategic elements offer a rewarding challenge. Put your honed arcade skills and quick judgment to the test to achieve the highest score and unlock difficult achievements!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964140?t=1761885343","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964140?t=1761885343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/0ba32c2483561c45bbc0955a94afbdd333d70776/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761885343","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/0ba32c2483561c45bbc0955a94afbdd333d70776/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761885343","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is <strong>OK to stream/broadcast</strong>. However, please ensure the game title, <strong>&quot;O-Sushi Claw Machine,&quot;</strong> is included in the video description or summary section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300eSushi Claw Machine\u300f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh take on the crane game genre, set in a Japanese conveyor belt sushi restaurant! Experience the ultimate claw machine simulation, bringing the excitement and authentic arcade atmosphere right to your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a physics-based crane arm to grab a variety of colorful sushi plates as they glide by on the conveyor belt. The price of the sushi you grab is added to your total, and the total cost of your feast becomes your final score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the gameplay is simple enough for anyone to enjoy, its deep strategic elements offer a rewarding challenge. Put your honed arcade skills and quick judgment to the test to achieve the highest score and unlock difficult achievements!</p>","developers":["Mihaya"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964140/528bcf6a40916e4e65e12319336bc312e51a9837/header.jpg?t=1761885343","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3964140/40382303/43742a7821b57cfc7cc657f1bb240c2c571242c4/1758594163/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758595235","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3964140/40382303/43742a7821b57cfc7cc657f1bb240c2c571242c4/1758594163/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758595235","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3964140/40382303/43742a7821b57cfc7cc657f1bb240c2c571242c4/1758594163/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758595235","id":257204376,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25720437